OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm angry but now I want to focus
OL,4,Aon my constituents' - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Suffolk MP is returning to
OL,7,FWestminster after the "hardest part" of
OL,8,Fhis life and says his focus will be on
OL,9,Fdelivering for his constituents.
OL,11,FPatrick Spencer, who represents Central
OL,12,FSuffolk and North Ipswich, was
OL,13,Ftemporarily removed from the
OL,14,FConservative parliamentary party and
OL,15,Ftold to stay away from Westminster
OL,16,Fafter being charged following
OL,17,Fallegations of sexual assault. He was
OL,18,Fcleared by a jury in July.
OL,20,FHe says he is sad and angry about his
OL,21,Fprosecution which he believes may have
OL,22,Fbeen brought because he is an MP.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
