OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm angry but now I want to focus
OL,4,Aon my constituents' - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut now, as the new parliamentary year
OL,7,Fbegins, he is able to sit in the House
OL,8,Fof Commons again as a Conservative MP
OL,9,Fwhere he says he will focus on issues
OL,10,Flike solar farms, house building and
OL,11,Ftrying to improve the local economy.
